+  criteria:
+  - "PROOF: python3 scripts/audit_board_evidence.py --verbose | grep -cE '^BOUND AUG-(120|123|127|135)\
+    \ .*\\(pass\\)' prints 4. FAILIF: any count other than 4 \u2014 one of the four\
+    \ rows this task names is unbound, or is bound to a verdict that is not a pass."
+  - "PROOF: jq -r 'select(.id==\"AUG-120\" or .id==\"AUG-123\" or .id==\"AUG-127\"\
+    \ or .id==\"AUG-135\") | .id + \" \" + .status + \" \" + .evidence_run_id' .coding-hermes/board/tasks.jsonl\
+    \ prints four lines reading AUG-120 complete 6ea40f07, AUG-123 complete e3421934,\
